flowchart LR
    Recruiter[Recruiter] --> Job[Create job and structured requirements]
    Candidate[Candidate] --> Apply[Submit application and resume]
    Job --> Store[(SQLite)]
    Apply --> Upload[Validate and queue resume]
    Upload --> Extract[Extract text]
    Extract --> Parse[Sections, skills, experience, education, certifications]
    Parse --> Store
    Store --> Match[Local semantic matching]
    Job --> Match
    Match --> Score[Explainable weighted ATS heuristic]
    Score --> Rank[Job-specific ranking suggestions]
    Rank --> Review[Human recruiter review]
    Review --> Decision[Recruiter decision]
    Review -. planned, not root-integrated .-> Voice[Voice screening]
    Voice -. planned .-> HR[HR interview]
    HR -. planned .-> Technical[Technical interview]
    Technical -. planned .-> MachineTest[Machine test]
    MachineTest -. planned .-> FinalDecision[Final decision support]
    FinalDecision -. planned .-> Offer[Offer automation]
